  5693	## Review result
  5694	
  5695	Revision 3 is not ready. Its D887 route selection is now correctly scoped, and most round-2 defects are repaired, but the latency pilot and D569 wall remain structurally censored by the unchanged 180-second round deadline. That invalidates the measured-budget design and its provenance.
