   283	  - W1 shows a lifted legacy round receiving 1,800,000 and accepting an answer after 200 s of policy clock that the sol control censors.
   284	  - W2 shows the dm-mode control clamped from 240 000 to 179 975 (the existing literal arithmetic of `ai-dm-conversation.test.ts:1428-1434`) while gpt-6-luna receives 1,800,000.
   285	  - W7 shows the blind engine deadline is gone.
   286	  - §4.4 specifies each witness.
